# Git repo of our DTA mods, in place in the game folder. Everything is ignored (DTA's own files, saves, logs, client
# settings), except the repo files, Modding/ and the game files that Modding/tools/dta-capture.ps1 lists in the generated
# block below (our new files + the DTA files we changed). Patched binaries (game.exe, Vinifera.dll) are rebuilt by scripts.
# Wiki: Modding/wiki/workflow/repo-and-updates.md
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/Modding/

# Modding: local only (binary cache, zips duplicating the archive folders, probe logs, built installer)
/Modding/.dta-cache/
/Modding/dist/
/Modding/archive/*.zip
/Modding/tools/*.log

# >>> dta-capture: generated by Modding/tools/dta-capture.ps1 (do not edit; change Modding/dta/sync.json instead)
